isk", "node": "RISK:DRIFT_NONSTATIONARITY"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPM-022", "label": "Study family SF-APPM-022: Superstar suppression profiles (incl. Q5c sequential triggering)", "score": 0.866, "reached_via": ["request matches the question or hypothesis of FAM:SF-APPM-022 (0.75)", "request matches DS:NBA_play_by_play_possessions_and_reconstructed_lineups (0.74); FAM:SF-APPM-022 auto_uses_dataset DS:NBA_play_by_play_possessions_and_reconstructed_lineups"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Superstar suppression profiles (incl. Q5c sequential triggering)", "auto_outcome_status": "inconclusive", "observed_hypothesis": "Specific opposing lineups, defenders, play types and preceding opponent play types suppress star efficiency.", "observed_result": "Q5c verdict 'rank-1 suppressor varies meaningfully across players'; e.g. Jokic after opp POST_UP 1.1271 (-0.0675, SE +/-0.0500, n=480); Curry forced POST_UP -0.209.", "auto_failure_mechanism": "E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)", "observed_failure_evidence": "Rank-1 deltas mostly within 1-2 SE with no multiple-comparison control; OTHER artifact flagged in doc.", "observed_sample_and_power": "SE per cell reported", "auto_validation_status": "no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED", "observed_verdict": "inconclusive", "observed_failure_type": "E_unclear", "observed_notes": "NOT_RECORDED", "auto_confidence": "medium (0.65)"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF-APPA-050"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-CHT-039", "label": "Study family SF-CHT-039: Series-level AVOID share vs winning (talent confound)", "score": 0.725, "reached_via": ["request matches the question or hypothesis of FAM:SF-CHT-039 (0.73)"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Series-level AVOID share vs winning (talent confound)", "auto_outcome_status": "untestable", "observed_hypothesis": "Higher AVOID share predicts losing, independent of team quality.", "observed_result": "Game-level rho=-0.19 p=0.008 (inflated n, team-quality confound). Series-level rho=-0.26 p=0.07 (n=50, underpowered; ~80 series needed for p<0.05). Low AVOID-share bin 52.6% vs 25-50% bin 37.0%.", "auto_failure_mechanism": "A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)", "observed_failure_evidence": "Series n=50 p=0.07; still confounded by team quality (OKC disciplined and good).", "observed_sample_and_power": "n=50 series; stated need ~80 for p<0.05", "auto_validation_status": "no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED", "observed_verdict": "inconclusive"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:confounding"}, {"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:small_sample"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:CONFOUNDING"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF18", "label": "Study family SF18: Fragility confirmatory: F1a usage decoupling and F1b split-half stability of residual influence", "score": 0.678, "reached_via": ["FAM:SF17 auto_related_family (record_link_related_to) FAM:SF18", "request matches RQC:RQC-011 (0.71); FAM:SF18 auto_addresses_question RQC:RQC-011"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Fragility confirmatory: F1a usage decoupling and F1b split-half stability of residual influence", "auto_outcome_status": "supported", "observed_hypothesis": "Structural influence is not reducible to usage and the usage-residual is a reproducible player property.", "observed_result": ["[APPA-039] F1a cosine R2=0.094, residual-share=0.906, CI [0.768, 0.962] PASS; Frobenius R2=0.073 share=0.927 CI [0.828, 0.965]. F1b pooled-residual rho=+0.685 p=0.0000 CI [+0.649, +0.721]; usage-partial rho=+0.557 p=0.00 [cut; read_family for the full text]", "[APPS-083] F1a cosine R2=0.099 share=0.901 CI[0.778,0.954]; frobenius R2=0.084 share=0.916. F1b pooled rho=+0.670 p=0.0000 CI[+0.636,+0.705]; partial rho=+0.560 CI[+0.496,+0.616]. F1a=CONFIRMED F1b=CONFIRMED."], "auto_failure_mechanism": "D_positive (no failure: positive result